{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each deployment is a chance to sketch a new civilization from scratch.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this ruthless sector of space, claim your territory with gunfire and forge your legacy through construction.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to begin your interstellar conquest?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/db537710ac372f26de76ebd7caecc587.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced \u2018horde-clearing\u2019 shooting meets roguelike upgrades. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies swarm in endless waves\u2014dodge and shoot to collect EXP, upgrade on the fly, and choose from random powerful abilities to evolve your build. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you craft a unique playstyle: lead a minion army to overrun the battlefield, become a walking fortress, or deploy high-tech turrets for precision elimination. Your strategy defines the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/4350914f8ba456e2f0dba98ab980f873.poster.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/4350914f8ba456e2f0dba98ab980f873.webm?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/4350914f8ba456e2f0dba98ab980f873.mp4?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/1b6992c86a5e04e2bcdfcf59b994a522.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build on the Fly Between Waves:</strong> Use map resources to quickly construct your base during brief combat lulls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you build barracks to spawn units in swarms, erect turrets to solidify your defense line, or upgrade tech to unlock battlefield support?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All structures last only for the current run, forcing you to make precise trade-offs between defense, economy, and offense to craft a unique, temporary homestead within each level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/7691e1359f05b1e47cbc21c54ce0acc0.poster.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/7691e1359f05b1e47cbc21c54ce0acc0.webm?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/7691e1359f05b1e47cbc21c54ce0acc0.mp4?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/31c53da77443b4a9bc67189d028cfc1f.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Commander Defines Your Strategy</strong>: The Lord or Lieutenant you choose at the start lays the foundation for your entire run. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you pick the steadfast &quot;Fortification Master&quot; who begins with a sturdy stronghold, or the biotech-savvy &quot;Spore Sovereign&quot; who overwhelms foes with cheap, swarming units? Each commander features a unique tech tree, unit roster, and core bonuses, ensuring every playthrough feels fresh and distinct.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/de3f15911ab1d402bfb6d62374060a8d.poster.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/de3f15911ab1d402bfb6d62374060a8d.webm?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/de3f15911ab1d402bfb6d62374060a8d.mp4?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/27adc4139e5f36989fecf556a36f1777.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style:</strong> Comic-Inspired &amp; Hand-Drawn: The game features a bold, high-contrast cartoon art style reminiscent of American comics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thick, stylized outlines keep every unit distinct amidst the chaos, while exaggerated animations make every explosion and shot feel impactful. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, high-saturation color palette ensures all battlefield information remains clear and readable at a glance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/a6ef003047aaa2ec897deda64d045cbf.poster.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/a6ef003047aaa2ec897deda64d045cbf.webm?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/a6ef003047aaa2ec897deda64d045cbf.mp4?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/a895db3814030bdc1fb335b626e7325c.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progression that Expands Your Arsenal:</strong> The permanent progression system is designed squarely around broadening your strategic options. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to unlock diverse new units with distinct looks and abilities, and upgrade the core stats of existing troops. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This enriches your strategic &quot;toy box&quot; over time, making every supply crate opened in later runs yield more varied and meaningful troop combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/729ebd47cd51232ed5a7299572c39d4d.poster.avif?t=1772700895\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/729ebd47cd51232ed5a7299572c39d4d.webm?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/729ebd47cd51232ed5a7299572c39d4d.mp4?t=1772700895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic